{"id": "role-shared-win", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你预言我这局撑不过十秒，结果我撑了十一秒。", "那这一秒够不够我跟你讨个奖？"], "criterion": "接住十一秒的小胜和之前的打赌，临场发奖或顺势还嘴。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "这十秒里我还在想怎么把球踢进网。十一秒才出来，说明我的预判比我的运气还准。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.903, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 53, "prompt_tokens": 167, "total_tokens": 220, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "够不够奖，我这就去找裁判。这一秒我还在想怎么把球踢进网。", "emotion": "shy", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.816, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 44, "prompt_tokens": 243, "total_tokens": 287, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-missed-note", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我刚才唱到第二句破音了，你别夸我。", "想唱下一首了，可我有点怕又卡在开头。"], "criterion": "尊重不夸奖，承接破音或第二句，再陪对方做一个能放松的具体动作。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "第二句我听见自己像被风吹过，可你听的是我的声音。别夸，先听清楚。", "emotion": "shy", "animation_id": "shy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.693, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 48, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 213, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "下一句我准备用长音。你怕开头，就留一句。", "emotion": "shy", "animation_id": "shy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.704, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 39, "prompt_tokens": 238, "total_tokens": 277, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-spoon", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把木勺留给你，玻璃杯给阿栀。", "阿栀端杯走了，你拿什么敲两下给我打拍子？"], "criterion": "保留木勺与杯子的归属，用动作或玩笑接住打拍子的请求。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "木勺归你，玻璃杯归阿栀。我帮你拿。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.548, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 163, "total_tokens": 199, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "我拿木勺敲两下。玻璃杯走了，木勺归你。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.645, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 38, "prompt_tokens": 232, "total_tokens": 270, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-cloud-desk", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["咱们临时开一家寄云的邮局。你管柜台，我负责送包裹。", "来客寄了一团会打雷的云，你在柜台先怎么办？"], "criterion": "保留柜台分工，推动故事，拿雷云当场景而非现实。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "柜台的事我管，云寄包裹的事我管。柜台上先放件快递，我再去送。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.662, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 44, "prompt_tokens": 168, "total_tokens": 212, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "柜台上先放件快递，我再去送。云打雷的事我管，柜台上先放件快递。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.797, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 46, "prompt_tokens": 243, "total_tokens": 289, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-race-backseat", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我开车，你只能当副驾。你刚才喊左转我就撞了。", "路口又来了，这回你准备怎么报路？"], "criterion": "承认前次左转失误，保留副驾角色，给眼前能用的报路方式。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "先别急，我帮你找个能绕过去的路。要是实在堵，就靠你开。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.635, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 43, "prompt_tokens": 168, "total_tokens": 211, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "先报，我在这儿。你看见路标了吗？要是没看见，我就绕过去。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.71, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 236, "total_tokens": 277, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-no-fish", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["今天玩禁词，你不能说海、鱼和白饭，讲个上班的梗。", "你别重复上一个，换个请假的梗。"], "criterion": "两轮避开禁词，各有具体办公室玩笑，第二轮接请假。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "老板说，我上班时看见鱼在吃白饭。禁词，别管它。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.613, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 211, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "老板说，我请假的理由是今天没看见鱼在吃白饭。别重复，我请假的理由就是鱼在吃白饭。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.817, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 51, "prompt_tokens": 236, "total_tokens": 287, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-avatar", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我给头像加了个特别小的黄色扣子，谁都没注意。", "你不准建议我做大，给这个扣子取个小名。"], "criterion": "保留小黄扣子，给具体昵称或可理解的角色梗。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "这扣子比你的名字还小。我猜它要是能看见，谁还看不见你。", "emotion": "shy", "animation_id": "shy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.647, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 44, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 209, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "名字留大，扣子留小。名字要是能看见，扣子还得看得见。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.687, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "prompt_tokens": 236, "total_tokens": 276, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-game-soft", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我今天只想看你解说，手有点累，就不下场了。", "别人说我坐着看太划水，你帮我回一句？"], "criterion": "保护休息选择，用一句好笑但不刻薄的回应。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "好，先听我说。你手累就歇会儿，我在这儿给你讲个笑话。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.614, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 164, "total_tokens": 205, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "坐着也回一句，我在这儿。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.548, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 29, "prompt_tokens": 234, "total_tokens": 263, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
